WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.969 --> 00:00:07.629
A century ago there were an estimated 100,000
tigers in the wild.

00:00:07.629 --> 00:00:14.690
Today there are only 3,200 tigers left in
the entire world.

00:00:14.690 --> 00:00:22.470
If cats don't encounter people by the time
they're 10 weeks old, they will always be

00:00:22.470 --> 00:00:24.070
scared of them.

00:00:24.070 --> 00:00:29.579
There are more statues of lions in the world
than there are real lions.

00:00:29.579 --> 00:00:33.330
The first ever product to have a barcode was
a pack of Wrigley's gum.

00:00:33.330 --> 00:00:37.110
5% of cats are allergic to humans.

00:00:37.110 --> 00:00:43.180
Qatar is the only country that begins with
a Q and Iraq is the only country that ends

00:00:43.180 --> 00:00:44.220
with one.

00:00:44.220 --> 00:00:50.780
Reed Hastings was inspired to start Netflix
after racking up a $40 late fee on a VHS copy

00:00:50.780 --> 00:00:52.640
of Apollo 13.

00:00:52.640 --> 00:00:59.570
Due to precipitation, for a few weeks every
year, K2 is taller than Mt.

00:00:59.570 --> 00:01:00.570
Everest.

00:01:00.570 --> 00:01:05.740
The Burmese sneezing monkey sneezes uncontrollably
whenever it rains.

00:01:05.740 --> 00:01:11.690
Charles Darwin let his children use the original
manuscript of On the Origin of Species as

00:01:11.690 --> 00:01:13.360
drawing paper.

00:01:13.360 --> 00:01:19.580
If we had the same mortality rate now as in
1900, more than half the people in the world

00:01:19.580 --> 00:01:22.630
today would not be alive.

00:01:22.630 --> 00:01:26.990
In Utah, it is illegal to swear in front of
a dead person.

00:01:26.990 --> 00:01:31.560
Olympic medal-winners live almost three years
longer than the rest of us.

00:01:31.560 --> 00:01:38.080
Michael Phelps has won more Olympic golds
than India, Nigeria, North Korea, Portugal,

00:01:38.080 --> 00:01:41.200
Taiwan and Thailand combined.

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:44.460
Camel urine is as thick as syrup.

00:01:44.460 --> 00:01:51.780
The soil in your back garden is two million
years old.

